                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>结果复算</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>按规则能否得到结论：原始记录、逐项判分与汇总</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, height: 30, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#276FBF' }}>保留未知与未完成</Text>
